abstract: "An alpha browser artwork structured around one generated shader, interface withdrawal without retrieval, and non-exclusive transfer of executable source. The baseline work uses authored WebGL2 families, local validation, bounded encounter traces, and an optional opt-in local-model proposal mechanism."
